      "text": "[~ 3]"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0040_doctor_05",
      "hash": "d72bd87e07085de2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 4]"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0040_doctor_03",
      "hash": "d72bd27e070853b0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：喂，你要去哪里！？\\n快回来！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0040_rival_02",
      "hash": "14283ebd92c1b1c4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_rival_01",
      "hash": "300dda520826e5ae",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：大木博士！\\c\\n那边刚才明明就只有２个精灵球的，\\n现在怎么变成３个了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_doctor_01",
      "hash": "4e6eefdd0a5feaff",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：没事没事！\\n那里有１个是[VAR TRNAME(0000)]刚才\\r\\n捉到的[VAR POKNAME(0002)]唷！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_rival_02",
      "hash": "300dd9520826e3fb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：是[VAR TRNAME(0000)]\\n自己捉到的吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_rival_03",
      "hash": "300dd8520826e248",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哇！吓我一跳！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_doctor_02",
      "hash": "4e6ef0dd0a5fecb2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：哇哈哈哈！\\n真是有意思唷！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_doctor_04",
      "hash": "4e6eeadd0a5fe280",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]啊！\\n这次记得要把精灵球\\r\\n牢牢地抓在手里喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_doctor_03",
      "hash": "4e6ef1dd0a5fee65",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好了！快过去拿\\n属于你的[VAR POKNAME(0002)]吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_rival_04",
      "hash": "300ddf520826ee2d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]捉到的宝可梦\\n好像在中间的那个精灵球里啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_rival_05",
      "hash": "300dde520826ec7a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：它好像在说\\n“不是那边呀”似的！"
    }
  ],
